  "name": "Chicken with Chorizo, Peppers, and Saffron Mash",
  "subtitle": "Roasted chicken with smoky peppers and golden saffron potatoes",
  "description": "Chicken thighs roast with chorizo, peppers, onion, garlic, and herbs while creamy saffron mash cooks alongside.",
